	"description"		"[h1]Storage Themes[/h1]

Painted themes for storage bays, smuggler bays, the hypertech bay, and machine bays. Switch appearance to open the theme panel and pick a skin.

Cosmetic only. Capacity and contents stay the same.

Storage bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/1.png[/img]

Large storage bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/2.png[/img]

Smuggler bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/s1.png[/img]

Large smuggler bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/s2.png[/img]

Machine bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/m1.png[/img]

Extended machine bay

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/m2.png[/img]

[h3]How to use[/h3]

[list]
[*]Switch appearance on a supported container. The theme panel opens.
[*]Pick a skin. Storage bays also keep the game's Original, Orange, and Dark looks.
[/list]

[h3]Skins[/h3]

[list]
[*]Storage bays and the hypertech bay: Blank, Chemistry, Chip, Fish, Food, Grape, Household, Material, Medical, Plant, Luxury, Water, and Weapon.
[*]Machine bays: Blank, Chemistry, Fish, Food, Grape, Household, Material, Meat, Plant, Water, and Weapon. The bay still shows how full it is, and the skin stays on.
[*]Smuggler bays: Card, Chip, Medical, Plant, and Weapon.
[/list]

[h3]Settings[/h3]

[list]
[*]Open the Mods list, then click Settings on this mod.
[*]Storage bays, smuggler bays, the hypertech bay, and machine bays each have their own switch. The game asks for a restart. A kind that is off shows its original art.
[/list]

[h3]Feedback & Source[/h3]

[list]
[*]Repository: [url=https://github.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods]canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods[/url]
[*]Bugs and requests go on [url=https://github.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/issues]GitHub Issues[/url].
[*]If you like the work and want to support it: [url=https://ko-fi.com/canisminor1990]ko-fi.com/canisminor1990[/url]
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]储物舱涂装 / Storage Themes[/h1]

[i]给储物舱、暗格、超科技舱和机械舱换上绘制的涂装。切换外观即可打开涂装面板，点选一种皮肤。[/i]

只改外观，不改变容量和里面的东西。

储物舱

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/1.png[/img]

大号储物舱

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/2.png[/img]

暗格

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/s1.png[/img]

改进暗格

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/s2.png[/img]

机械舱

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/m1.png[/img]

扩展机械舱

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/main/src/StorageThemes/screenshots/m2.png[/img]

[h3]怎么用[/h3]

[list]
[*]在这些容器上切换外观，会打开涂装面板。
[*]点选一种涂装。储物舱还会保留游戏原来的原图、橙色和深色。
[/list]

[h3]涂装[/h3]

[list]
[*]储物舱和超科技舱：空白、化学、芯片、鱼、食物、葡萄、日用、材料、医疗、植物、奢侈品、水、武器。
[*]机械舱：空白、化学、鱼、食物、葡萄、日用、材料、肉类、植物、水、武器。往里放东西时，仍然能看出装了多少，涂装不会掉。
[*]暗格：磁卡、芯片、医疗、植物、武器。
[/list]

[h3]设置[/h3]

[list]
[*]打开模组列表，点击本模组的「设置」。
[*]储物舱、暗格、超科技舱、机械舱可以分别开关。游戏会要求重启。关掉的那一类显示原来的样子。
[/list]

[h3]问题反馈与源码[/h3]

[list]
[*]模组仓库：[url=https://github.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods]canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods[/url]
[*]问题请开 [url=https://github.com/canisminor1990/probably-stolen-mods/issues]GitHub Issues[/url]。
[*]喜欢这些模组、想支持一下：[url=https://ko-fi.com/canisminor1990]ko-fi.com/canisminor1990[/url]
[/list]"
